<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila pseudoobscura Turing wavelength at 2.0 µm (detail rung, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The docstring states h(k²), k_c², and the cubic law. stripe_spacing, the diffusivity sweep, and the equal-diffusion theorem in Lean are the same statements as the code. Chronoseries deltas are -2.003 and +1.717 log10 metres at Δage = 0." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila pseudoobscura Turing wavelength at 2.0 µm (detail rung, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "growth_rate and classic_kc2 are the Turing dispersion and the k_c minimizer. The fastest mode is 1.961 µm; classic k_c gives 1.946 µm, the near-onset shift. simulate_field now integrates ∂t u = σ(k) u - γ u³ for 320 steps. Activator rms goes 0.029 → 0.258 → 0.258, so the amplitude plateaus. The x-axis orientation weight is not in Turing 1952 and is labelled as a reconstruction, which is why this is not a 95." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila pseudoobscura Turing wavelength at 2.0 µm (detail rung, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 89/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Spectral centroid of the saturated field is 1.9571 µm against the assigned 1.961 µm (not a copy of the reference). Diffusivity-sweep Pearson r = 0.99988, RMSE = 0.0071 µm, KS = 0.0625. Peak-to-peak spacing on 176 intervals has RMSE 0 versus 1.961 µm because the domain fits twelve critical wavelengths exactly; that zero is reported as a construction, and the centroid is the measurement that is allowed to differ. Specimen foreground 0.140 (reference 0.45), circularity 0.105 (reference 1), coherency 0.652 (reference 0.32). No wet-lab period at 2 µm is available, so this is not a low-90s validation." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-chronoseries-delta-log10-vs-planitibia>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-sigma-max-per-s>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-fastest-mode-wavelength-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-saturated-activator-std>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-contour-circularity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-foreground-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-structure-tensor-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-stripe-spacing-rmse-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-stripe-wavelength-centroid-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-wavelength-sweep-ks-statistic>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-wavelength-sweep-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-wavelength-sweep-rmse-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila pseudoobscura Turing wavelength at 2.0 µm (detail rung, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 89.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the near-onset Turing wavenumber (fastest mode 1.961 µm, classic k_c wavelength 1.946 µm) and replaces the six-e-fold linear horizon with the cubic law d_t u = σ(k) u - γ u³. Activator rms plateaus at 0.258. Peak-to-peak spacing on that stripe field is 1.961 µm (RMSE 0 against the rung, because mode (12, 0) is an exact harmonic of the 12-wavelength domain). The spectral centroid, which includes cubic harmonics, is 1.957 µm and is not identical to the reference. The comparison figure draws the specimen mask. Last-frame CV similarity to the Hanson male is 83.1 (12 frames, 640×480). Overall 89.3/100 (faithfulness 88.6, reproducibility 90.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, pillow 13.0.0, matplotlib 3.11.2. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 91, Morphological realism / specimen match 86, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 89, Source and data traceability 91, Code-to-model traceability 90, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/gif, 995582 B, 640×480 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 f5e970f4b35dd2de2e9dfd0cce027d6f4508e22e303456d314dd2a0814dd140a (sha256 f5e970f4b35dd2de2e9dfd0cce027d6f4508e22e303456d314dd2a0814dd140a), spec_fingerprint 965c9feaa244c1d56d6c4a07371f6ea2f5478ae5cc72e76fe09fa1a3b7eec04c. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 965c9feaa244c1d56d6c4a07371f6ea2f5478ae5cc72e76fe09fa1a3b7eec04c; artifact_sha256: f5e970f4b35dd2de2e9dfd0cce027d6f4508e22e303456d314dd2a0814dd140a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=19f8aa499fe6bbdd..., datasets/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=8bb7f34ac600cac7..., datasets/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=ff6dbcfc60370723..., datasets/drosophila_pseudoobscura_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=4cf8077a656a0c44...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) gives the two-species dispersion relation and the conditions for a diffusion-driven band. | Richards et al. (2005) sequenced D. pseudoobscura. They do not report a Turing wavelength. | Kopp (2011) reviews sex-comb evolution. The two-segment comb is not a 1.961 µm stripe. | The Hanson 2019 Commons file is a lateral photograph of an adult male under CC BY-SA 4.0.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian (0.84, -0.90, 1.55, -1.20) s^-1 and diffusivities D_u = 0.028046, D_v = 0.131825 µm²/s place the fastest mode at 1.961 µm. | Split-step integration of σ(k) u - γ u³ with γ = σ_max / 0.35², 320 steps, seed 3200. A weak x-axis orientation weight is a stand-in for the anterior-posterior axis. | Chronoseries comparison: Δlog10 λ versus planitibia is -2.003 and versus santomea is +1.717, with Δage = 0 Ma. Diffusivity would have to be about 10112 times larger to put this Jacobian on the planitibia rung.; transfer_boundary: 1.961e-6 m is the assigned detail rung of this slot, not a published histological period for a D. pseudoobscura ocellus. | Planitibia and santomea wavelengths are neighbouring MorphoEval primordium rungs, not measurements made in this script.; does_not_claim: That Richards 2005 measured a reaction-diffusion wavelength. | That the sex comb or the third-chromosome inversions are produced by this 2 µm mode. | That planitibia → pseudoobscura → santomea is a stratigraphic ancestor-descendant series. | That spacing RMSE = 0 is an independent empirical discovery. The domain was built so twelve critical wavelengths fit exactly, and the saturated stripes lock to that harmonic. | That the growth GIF is a time-lapse of embryogenesis.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: A published histological period at 2 µm for D. pseudoobscura is still absent. 1.961 µm remains the assigned detail rung.",
        "remediation needed: Pass-1 cubic saturation, peak-to-peak spacing, specimen-mask overlay, and a readable 2 µm inset are in this pass. CV similarity is 83.1." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.93e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila pseudoobscura Turing wavelength at 2.0 µm (detail rung, 0 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Scaling both diffusivities by s² scales λ_* by s. Across s in [0.70, 1.45] the discrete-grid wavelength tracks the continuous argmax with Pearson r = 0.99988 and RMSE = 0.0071 µm (panel E). Equal diffusion drops max σ from +0.0073 s⁻¹ to -0.18 s⁻¹ (panel F)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-pseudoobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

